<title>UK: London sugar freight.</title>
<headline>London sugar freight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEW ORDERS - CSR 25,000 bulk Queensland to South China Aug 1/10.</p>
<p>Genoc 12,000/14,500 bulk Thailand to Vladivostok prompt and 25,000 bulk Santos, Rio or Paranagua to Umm Qasr prompt.</p>
<p>S.African Sugar Assn 34,000 bulk Durban to Jeddah for mid Aug.</p>
<p>FIXTURES - Market talk said that E.D.&amp; F Man paid about $29 for 25,000 bulk Paranagua to Black Sea for mid July.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
